<rml>
<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only -->
<head>
	<title>Entrar</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
	<style>
		.stage
		{
			position: absolute;
			top: 0dp; left: 0dp; right: 0dp; bottom: 0dp;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: var(--s9);
		}
		.copy { width: 720dp; }
		.copy h1 { margin-top: var(--s4); margin-bottom: var(--s4); }
		.copy .lead { font-size: var(--t-lg); color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.45em; }

		.code-card
		{
			margin-top: var(--s7);
			padding: var(--s6) var(--s6);
			border-radius: var(--r-xl);
			background-color: var(--surface);
			border: 1.5dp var(--line);
		}
		.code
		{
			font-family: "Inter Display";
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: var(--t-hero);
			letter-spacing: 8dp;
			color: var(--text);
			margin-top: var(--s2);
		}
		.code.placeholder { color: var(--text-3); }
		.uri { font-size: var(--t-lg); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
		.status
		{
			margin-top: var(--s5);
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			gap: var(--s3);
			color: var(--text-2);
		}
		.status.err { color: var(--danger); }
		.actions { margin-top: var(--s6); display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: var(--s3); }

		.qr-wrap
		{
			width: 420dp;
			padding: var(--s5);
			border-radius: var(--r-xl);
			background-color: #ffffff;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.qr-wrap img { width: 372dp; height: 372dp; }
		.qr-wrap .cap { color: #3a4150; font-size: var(--t-sm); font-weight: 600; margin-top: var(--s3); }
		.qr-empty
		{
			width: 420dp;
			height: 470dp;
			border-radius: var(--r-xl);
			border: 1.5dp var(--line);
			background-color: var(--surface);
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body class="solid" data-model="fluvi">
	<div class="topbar">
		<div class="wordmark">Fluvi<span class="dot">.</span></div>
		<div class="right">
			<button class="ghost" id="signin-settings" data-event-click="open_settings">Configurações</button>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="stage enter">
		<div class="copy">
			<div class="eyebrow">XBOX REMOTE PLAY</div>
			<h1>Entre com sua conta Microsoft</h1>
			<div class="lead">Abra o endereço abaixo no celular ou no computador e digite o código. A janela continua sozinha quando o login terminar.</div>

			<div class="code-card elev-2">
				<div class="uri">{{ sign.uri_short }}</div>
				<div class="code" data-if="sign.has_code">{{ sign.code }}</div>
				<div class="code placeholder" data-if="!sign.has_code">····-····</div>
				<div class="status" data-class-err="sign.error">
					<div class="spinner" data-if="sign.busy"></div>
					<span>{{ sign.status }}</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="actions">
				<button class="primary autofocus" id="signin-start" data-if="!sign.busy" data-event-click="sign_in">Entrar</button>
				<button id="signin-cancel" data-if="sign.busy" data-event-click="cancel_sign_in">Cancelar</button>
				<button class="ghost" id="signin-quit" data-event-click="quit">Sair</button>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="qr-wrap elev-3" data-if="sign.has_qr">
			<img data-attr-src="sign.qr"/>
			<div class="cap">Aponte a câmera do celular</div>
		</div>
		<div class="qr-empty" data-if="!sign.has_qr">
			<div class="spinner" data-if="sign.busy"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
